><span class=\"text-roll-inner\"><span>Visit Lazimpat</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-[#1F3A2B]\">Visit Lazimpat</span></span></span></a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#F4EFE6] hover:bg-[#EBF0EC] border border-[#E6DFD5] transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Open Cart\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-bag w-4 h-4 text-[#1F3A2B]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.103 6.034h17.794\"></path><path d=\"M3.4 5.467a2 2 0 0 0-.4 1.2V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6.667a2 2 0 0 0-.4-1.2l-2-2.667A2 2 0 0 0 17 2H7a2 2 0 0 0-1.6.8z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#1F3A2B] font-sans\">0</span></button><button class=\"md:hidden p-1.5 rounded-full text-[#1F3A2B] hover:bg-[#F4EFE6] transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></nav></header><section class=\"hero-section relative h-screen w-full flex flex-col justify-between items-center text-center px-4 overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-10\"><div class=\"hero-bg-parallax absolute inset-0 -top-[10%] -bottom-[10%] w-full h-[120%] z-0\"><img src=\"/images/nepal-hills.svg\" alt=\"Nepal Himalayan hills and tea garden terraces\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center filter brightness-[0.92]\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#14261C]/50 via-transparent to-[#14261C]/75\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 my-auto max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/15 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 text-[#E8B931] text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-sans font-semibold mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles lucide-stars w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Small Batch Kitchen • Lazimpat</span></div><h1 class=\"headline-mask-reveal font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-white uppercase leading-[1.08] drop-shadow-md\">Crafted <span class=\"font-normal italic lowercase font-serif tracking-normal text-[#FAF6EE]\">in the</span> Himalayas</h1><p class=\"mt-5 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-white/90 font-sans max-w-xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed drop-shadow-xs\">Hand-churned cultured cream butter infused with wild mountain honey, smoked chillies, and roasted garlic.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><a href=\"#flavours\" class=\"group relative w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-[#1F3A2B] hover:bg-[#2A4E3B] text-white text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-sans rounded-sm transition-all shadow-md overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"text-roll\"><span class=\"text-roll-inner\"><span>Shop the Butters</span><span class=\"text-[#E8B931]\">Shop the Butters</span></span></span></a><a href=\"#visit\" class=\"group relative w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/25 text-white backdrop-blur-md border border-white/40 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-sans rounded-sm transition-all overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"text-roll\"><span class=\"text-roll-inner\"><span>Visit Lazimpat</span><span class=\"text-[#E8B931]\">Visit Lazimpat</span></span></span></a></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><a href=\"#flavours\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 text-white/80 hover:text-white text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-sans font-medium transition-all\"><span>Scroll to Explore</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-bounce\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section id=\"flavours\" class=\"py-24 px-6 sm:px-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-sans font-semibold text-[#1F3A2B]\">The Flavour Range</span><h2 class=\"headline-mask-reveal font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-[0.05em] text-[#1F3A2B] uppercase mt-3\">Butter <span class=\"italic font-normal lowercase font-serif\">the</span> Forest <span class=\"italic font-normal lowercase font-serif\">way</span></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5E6961] font-sans leading-relaxed\">Every jar is produced in limited quantities. We track batch codes and best-before dates on every unit so you receive peak freshness.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"product-card-stagger group relative bg-white border border-[#E6DFD5] rounded-xs p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#1F3A2B]/40 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-sans font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-[#E8B931] bg-[#1F3A2B] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\">Character No. 01</span><span class=\"text-xs font-serif text-[#5E6961] tracking-widest uppercase\">From NPR <!-- -->450</span></div><a class=\"block relative aspect-square my-4 bg-[#FBF9F5] border border-[#F4EFE6] rounded-xs overflow-hidden p-6 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500\" href=\"/products/hot-honey-butter\"><img src=\"/images/hot-honey-butter.svg\" alt=\"The Vanvasi Project - Hot Honey Butter Jar cutout\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain filter drop-shadow-xs\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><div class=\"mt-2 mb-6\"><a href=\"/products/hot-honey-butter\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-[0.08em] text-[#1F3A2B] uppercase hover:text-[#2D523E] transition-colors\">Hot Honey Butter</h3></a><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5E6961] font-sans mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Wildflower Himalayan honey meets slow-infused sun-dried chillies.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-[#F4EFE6] space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] text-[#5E6961] font-sans\"><span>Select Size</span><span class=\"text-[#1F3A2B] font-medium\">NPR <!-- -->450</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 px-3 text-xs font-sans rounded-xs border transition-all text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-[#1F3A2B] bg-[#1F3A2B] text-white font-semibold shadow-xs\"><span class=\"font-medium tracking-wide\">100 g</span><span class=\"text-[10px] mt-0.5 text-[#E8B931]\">NPR 450</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 px-3 text-xs font-sans rounded-xs border transition-all text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-[#E6DFD5] bg-[#FBF9F5] text-[#1C241E] hover:border-[#1F3A2B]/40\"><span class=\"font-medium tracking-wide\">250 g</span><span class=\"text-[10px] mt-0.5 text-[#5E6961]\">NPR 950</span></button></div></div><button class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xs text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest font-sans flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all duration-200 bg-[#1F3A2B] hover:bg-[#2A4E3B] text-white shadow-xs\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus w-4 h-4 text-[#E8B931]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><span>Add <!-- -->100 g<!-- --> to Basket</span></button><div class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-sans font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5E6961] hover:text-[#1F3A2B] transition-colors\" href=\"/products/hot-honey-butter\"><span>Read culinary pairings</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"product-card-stagger group relative bg-white border border-[#E6DFD5] rounded-xs p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#1F3A2B]/40 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-sans font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-[#E8B931] bg-[#1F3A2B] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\">Character No. 02</span><span class=\"text-xs font-serif text-[#5E6961] tracking-widest uppercase\">From NPR <!-- -->400</span></div><a class=\"block relative aspect-square my-4 bg-[#FBF9F5] border border-[#F4EFE6] rounded-xs overflow-hidden p-6 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500\" href=\"/products/garlic-butter\"><img src=\"/images/garlic-butter.svg\" alt=\"The Vanvasi Project - Garlic Butter Jar cutout\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain filter drop-shadow-xs\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><div class=\"mt-2 mb-6\"><a href=\"/products/garlic-butter\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-[0.08em] text-[#1F3A2B] uppercase hover:text-[#2D523E] transition-colors\">Garlic Butter</h3></a><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5E6961] font-sans mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Slow-roasted sweet garlic heads, highland thyme &amp; flaky sea salt.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-[#F4EFE6] space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] text-[#5E6961] font-sans\"><span>Select Size</span><span class=\"text-[#1F3A2B] font-medium\">NPR <!-- -->400</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 px-3 text-xs font-sans rounded-xs border transition-all text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-[#1F3A2B] bg-[#1F3A2B] text-white font-semibold shadow-xs\"><span class=\"font-medium tracking-wide\">100 g</span><span class=\"text-[10px] mt-0.5 text-[#E8B931]\">NPR 400</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 px-3 text-xs font-sans rounded-xs border transition-all text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-[#E6DFD5] bg-[#FBF9F5] text-[#1C241E] hover:border-[#1F3A2B]/40\"><span class=\"font-medium tracking-wide\">250 g</span><span class=\"text-[10px] mt-0.5 text-[#5E6961]\">NPR 850</span></button></div></div><button class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xs text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest font-sans flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all duration-200 bg-[#1F3A2B] hover:bg-[#2A4E3B] text-white shadow-xs\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus w-4 h-4 text-[#E8B931]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><span>Add <!-- -->100 g<!-- --> to Basket</span></button><div class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-sans font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5E6961] hover:text-[#1F3A2B] transition-colors\" href=\"/products/garlic-butter\"><span>Read culinary pairings</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"w-full h-12 contour-pattern\"></div><section id=\"story\" class=\"py-24 px-6 sm:px-10 bg-[#F4EFE6] border-y border-[#E6DFD5]\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-6 space-y-6\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-sans font-semibold text-[#1F3A2B]\">Origins &amp; Method</span><h2 class=\"headline-mask-reveal font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-[0.05em] text-[#1F3A2B] uppercase leading-tight\">Honest craft <span class=\"italic font-normal lowercase font-serif\">from the</span> valley kitchen</h2><div class=\"space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5E6961] font-sans leading-relaxed\"><p>The Vanvasi Project was born from a simple devotion: that butter should be more than an afterthought. We source fresh cultured dairy cream, churned patiently in small batches in Lazimpat, Kathmandu.</p><p>Our honey is wild-foraged by local beekeepers in eastern Nepal, and our garlic is slow-caramelized over low heat until rich and mellow. No artificial preservatives, stabilizers, or bulk commercial vegetable fats ever touch our kitchen.</p><p>Because we make real, unadulterated butter, each jar is perishable and dated with its specific batch code. When you open a jar of Vanvasi, you taste pure Himalayan land and dedicated craftsmanship.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 flex items-center gap-6\"><div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1F3A2B] block\">100%</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase font-sans text-[#5E6961]\">Natural Ingredients</span></div><div class=\"h-8 w-[1px] bg-[#D8D0C4]\"></div><div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1F3A2B] block\">Batch-Dated</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase font-sans text-[#5E6961]\">Directly Tracked</span></div><div class=\"h-8 w-[1px] bg-[#D8D0C4]\"></div><div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1F3A2B] block\">Lazimpat</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase font-sans text-[#5E6961]\">Kathmandu Workshop</span></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-6 relative\"><div class=\"image-clip-reveal relative rounded-xs overflow-hidden border border-[#D8D0C4] shadow-sm aspect-4/5 bg-[#203428]\"><img src=\"/images/kitchen-story.svg\" alt=\"Cultured butter churn and bread in Lazimpat kitchen\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"/></div></div></div></section><section id=\"visit\" class=\"py-24 px-6 sm:px-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-sans font-semibold text-[#1F3A2B]\">Fulfilment</span><h2 class=\"headline-mask-reveal font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-[0.05em] text-[#1F3A2B] uppercase mt-3\">Pickup <span class=\"italic font-normal lowercase font-serif\">or</span> Kathmandu Delivery</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5E6961] font-sans leading-relaxed\">Fresh jars are ready for pickup at our Lazimpat counter or delivered straight to your door across Kathmandu Valley.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#E6DFD5] p-8 rounded-xs space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#1F3A2B]/40 transition-colors\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#EBF0EC] flex items-center justify-center text-[#1F3A2B]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#1F3A2B] tracking-wider\">Kitchen Pickup</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5E6961] font-sans leading-relaxed\">Visit our workshop in Lazimpat to pick up your order directly from the churn. Zero delivery fees.</p><div class=\"space-y-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-[#F4EFE6] text-xs font-sans text-[#1C241E]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-[#1F3A2B] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>Nursery Road, Lazimpat, Kathmandu</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4 text-[#1F3A2B] flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path></svg><span>Pickup Hours: 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM (Sun – Fri)</span></div></div></div><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Lazimpat+Kathmandu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center py-3 px-6 bg-[#F4EFE6] hover:bg-[#EBF0EC] text-[#1F3A2B] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest font-sans rounded-xs transition-colors border border-[#E6DFD5]\">Open Google Maps Location</a></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#E6DFD5] p-8 rounded-xs space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#1F3A2B]/40 transition-colors\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#FFF8E6] flex items-center justify-center text-[#E8B931]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck w-6 h-6 text-[#9A7312]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#1F3A2B] tracking-wider\">Kathmandu Delivery</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5E6961] font-sans leading-relaxed\">Carefully packed in temperature-controlled bags to keep butter firm during transport. Available across Kathmandu Valley.</p><div class=\"space-y-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-[#F4EFE6] text-xs font-sans text-[#1C241E]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-4 h-4 text-[#1F3A2B] flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Cash on Delivery (NPR Only)</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4 text-[#1F3A2B] flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path></svg><span>Dispatched same day or next morning</span></div></div></div><a href=\"#flavours\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center py-3 px-6 bg-[#1F3A2B] hover:bg-[#2A4E3B] text-white text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest font-sans rounded-xs transition-colors shadow-xs\">Choose Flavours to Deliver</a></div></div></section><footer class=\"bg-[#14261C] text-[#FBF9F5] border-t border-[#2A4E3B] pt-16 pb-12 px-6 sm:px-10\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 pb-16 border-b border-white/10 items-start\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-20 h-20 text-[#FBF9F5]\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"92\" stroke=\"#FBF9F5\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 2\"></circle><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"82\" stroke=\"#FBF9F5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle><g transform=\"translate(60, 60) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M15 15 L50 85 L85 15\" stroke=\"#FBF9F5\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M28 26 C 38 42, 42 60, 50 68 C 58 60, 62 42, 72 26\" stroke=\"#FBF9F5\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0.75\"></path></g><path id=\"stampTextPath\" d=\"M 100, 100 m -68, 0 a 68,68 0 1,1 136,0 a 68,68 0 1,1 -136,0\" fill=\"none\"></path><text fill=\"#FBF9F5\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"serif\" letter-spacing=\"0.25em\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><textPath href=\"#stampTextPath\" startOffset=\"50%\">THE VANVASI PROJECT • LAZIMPAT •</textPath></text></svg><div><span class=\"font-serif tracking-[0.25em] text-sm uppercase text-[#FBF9F5] block font-semibold\">The Vanvasi Project</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-sans text-[#E8B931] font-medium\">Himalayan Small-Batch Butters</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[#FBF9F5]/70 max-w-sm font-sans leading-relaxed\">Crafted in Kathmandu from pure cultured cream, wild honey, and mountain herbs. Each batch is uniquely charactered and dated.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 space-y-4\"><h4 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#E8B931] font-sans font-semibold\">The Kitchen &amp; Workshop</h4><div class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[#FBF9F5]/80 font-sans\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-[#E8B931] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>Nursery Road, Lazimpat, Kathmandu, Nepal</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4 text-[#E8B931] flex-shrink-0\" aria-hid